 Radar: https://gon-uri.github.io/venue-radar/#waspaa-2027\nNotes: waspaa.
 com gives Levi\, Finland (first WASPAA in Europe)\, Sep 19-22\, 2027\, in
  a tentative schedule subject to small changes: abstract Apr 14\, final p
 aper Apr 21\, notification Jul 2\, camera-ready Jul 16. The IEEE SPS list
 ing gives the same place and dates\, paper deadline TBD. All stay estimat
 ed until the call is posted (waspaa.com/call-for-papers/ returned 404 on 
 2026-10-31). No hour or zone is posted\; 23:59 AoE follows 2025. The abst
 ract is treated as a mandatory gate\, as the 2025 initial CMT entry was. 
 Held every odd year since 1995. Size is an editorial estimate (169 attend
 ees\, 95 papers in 2025).
